#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of rsync"
msgstr "Instalação do rsync"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For security reasons, running the <application>rsync</application> server as"
" an unprivileged user and group is encouraged. If you intend to run "
"<command>rsync</command> as a daemon, create the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">rsyncd</systemitem> user and group with the following "
"commands issued by the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Por razões de segurança, executar o servidor "
"&quot;<application>rsync</application>&quot; como um(a) usuário(a) e grupo "
"sem privilégios é encorajado. Se você pretende executar o "
"&quot;<command>rsync</command>&quot; como um processo de segundo plano, "
"[então] crie o(a) usuário(a) e grupo &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">rsyncd</systemitem>&quot; com os seguintes comandos "
"emitidos pelo(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 48 rsyncd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"rsyncd Daemon\" -m -d /home/rsync -g rsyncd \\\n"
"    -s /bin/false -u 48 rsyncd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 48 rsyncd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Processo de segundo plano rsyncd\" -m -d /home/rsync -g rsyncd \\\n"
"    -s /bin/false -u 48 rsyncd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>rsync</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>rsync</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-xxhash \\\n"
"            --without-included-zlib &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --disable-xxhash \\\n"
"            --without-included-zlib &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> installed and wish to build HTML API"
" documentation, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o &quot;<xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>&quot; instalado e desejar "
"construir a documentação &quot;HTML&quot; da &quot;API&quot;, [então] emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>doxygen</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>doxygen</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue:"
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make check</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make check</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:149
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the documentation, install it using the following commands as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu a documentação, [então] instale-a usando os seguintes "
"comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d          /usr/share/doc/rsync-&rsync-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 dox/html/*  /usr/share/doc/rsync-&rsync-version;/api</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d         /usr/share/doc/rsync-&rsync-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 dox/html/*  /usr/share/doc/rsync-&rsync-version;/api</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-xxhash</parameter>: This switch disables advanced "
"xxhash checksum support. Remove this switch if you have installed <ulink "
"url=\"https://cyan4973.github.io/xxHash/\">xxhash</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-xxhash</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o suporte "
"avançado à soma de verificação &quot;xxhash&quot;. Remova essa chave se você"
" tiver instalado <ulink "
"url=\"https://cyan4973.github.io/xxHash/\">xxhash</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/rsync.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-included-zlib</parameter>: This switch enables "
"compilation with the system-installed zlib library."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-included-zlib</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"compilação com a biblioteca &quot;zlib&quot; instalada no sistema."

